  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "음~ 낯가림 블렌드로 즐기는\n우아한 한때...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C74C007E0020B0AFAC00B9BC0020BE14B80CB4DCB85C0020C990AE30B294000AC6B0C544D55C0020D55CB54C002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어서 오세요!\n통신을 좋아하는 사람들을 위한 카페<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n낯가림 카페입니다...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C11C0020C624C138C6940021000AD1B5C2E0C7440020C88BC544D558B2940020C0ACB78CB4E4C7440020C704D55C0020CE74D39800100001BE00000AB0AFAC00B9BC0020CE74D398C785B2C8B2E4002E002E002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으악! 짜!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73CC54500210020C9DC002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저기요!\n이 커피, 너무 짠 거 아니에요!?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AE30C6940021000AC7740020CEE4D53C002C0020B108BB340020C9E00020AC700020C544B2C8C5D0C6940021003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네? 저희 가게의 낯가림 블렌드는\n은은한 단맛과 풍부한 향이 특징인데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F0020C800D76C0020AC00AC8CC7580020B0AFAC00B9BC0020BE14B80CB4DCB294000AC740C740D55C0020B2E8B9DBACFC0020D48DBD80D55C0020D5A5C7740020D2B9C9D5C778B370002E002E002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "짠맛 같은 건\n날 리가 없다구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9E0B9DB0020AC19C7400020AC74000AB0A00020B9ACAC000020C5C6B2E4AD6CC694002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "솔솔~",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C194C194007E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗! 저건 베베솔트!?\n암염포켓몬 베베솔트예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C55700210020C800AC740020BCA0BCA0C194D2B80021003F000AC554C5FCD3ECCF13BAAC0020BCA0BCA0C194D2B8C608C694002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님, 부탁드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B2D8002C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커피에서 짠맛이 난 것과\n관련이 있는지 확인할 수 있게<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n베베솔트를 잡아 와 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4D53CC5D0C11C0020C9E0B9DBC7740020B09C0020AC83ACFC000AAD00B828C7740020C788B294C9C00020D655C778D5600020C2180020C788AC8C00100001BE00000ABCA0BCA0C194D2B8B97C0020C7A1C5440020C6400020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "옥상에 있던 베베솔트를\n잡아 와 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C625C0C1C5D00020C788B3580020BCA0BCA0C194D2B8B97C000AC7A1C5440020C6400020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으악! 짜!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73CC54500210020C9DC002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포획을 의뢰받은\n베베솔트가 있다...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n승부를 걸고 포획하겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECD68DC7440020C758B8B0BC1BC740000ABCA0BCA0C194D2B8AC000020C788B2E4002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC2B9BD80B97C0020AC78ACE00020D3ECD68DD558ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포획한다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECD68DD55CB2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그만둔다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9CCB454B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
