      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "베베솔트를 포획하지 못했다...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCA0BCA0C194D2B8B97C0020D3ECD68DD558C9C00020BABBD588B2E4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "베베솔트를 잡았다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCA0BCA0C194D2B8B97C0020C7A1C558B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "베베솔트를 잡으셨나요?\n그렇다면 가게로 돌아와 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCA0BCA0C194D2B8B97C0020C7A1C73CC168B098C694003F000AADF8B807B2E4BA740020AC00AC8CB85C0020B3CCC544C6400020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손님, 커피가 너무 짜다고 하셨죠?\n이 포켓몬을 봐 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C190B2D8002C0020CEE4D53CAC000020B108BB340020C9DCB2E4ACE00020D558C168C8E0003F000AC7740020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020BD100020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "베베솔트라는 포켓몬인데,\n몸이 암염으로 되어 있어서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n걸으면 소금이 떨어져 나온다고 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCA0BCA0C194D2B8B77CB2940020D3ECCF13BAACC778B370002C000ABAB8C7740020C554C5FCC73CB85C0020B418C5B40020C788C5B4C11C00100001BE00000AAC78C73CBA740020C18CAE08C7740020B5A8C5B4C8380020B098C628B2E4ACE00020D574C694002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "소금이 들어간 커피는\n새로 만들어 드릴 테니...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C18CAE08C7740020B4E4C5B4AC040020CEE4D53CB294000AC0C8B85C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B4DCB9B40020D14CB2C8002E002E002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안 그러셔도 돼요! 계속 마시다 보니\n이 짭짤한 맛에 중독되어 버렸거든요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5480020ADF8B7ECC154B3C40020B3FCC69400210020ACC4C18D0020B9C8C2DCB2E40020BCF4B2C8000AC7740020C9EDC9E4D55C0020B9DBC5D00020C911B3C5B418C5B40020BC84B838AC70B4E0C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커피에 소금을 넣어서 먹기도 하잖아요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4D53CC5D00020C18CAE08C7440020B123C5B4C11C0020BA39AE30B3C40020D558C796C544C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "낯가림 카페의 새로운 메뉴로\n출시해도 좋을 것 같은데요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0AFAC00B9BC0020CE74D398C7580020C0C8B85CC6B40020BA54B274B85C000ACD9CC2DCD574B3C40020C88BC7440020AC830020AC19C740B370C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네에!?\n네... 검토해 보겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124C5D00021003F000AB124002E002E002E0020AC80D1A0D5740020BCF4ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "베베솔트의 소금을 넣은\n깊은 맛의 베베솔트 커피...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCA0BCA0C194D2B8C7580020C18CAE08C7440020B123C740000AAE4AC7400020B9DBC7580020BCA0BCA0C194D2B80020CEE4D53C002E002E002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개발해 보려고 했는데,\n그냥 짠 정도가 아니라 과할 정도라...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n일단은 비밀 메뉴로만 팔 생각이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CBC1CD5740020BCF4B824ACE00020D588B294B370002C000AADF8B0E50020C9E00020C815B3C4AC000020C544B2C8B77C0020ACFCD5600020C815B3C4B77C002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC77CB2E8C7400020BE44BC000020BA54B274B85CB9CC0020D3140020C0DDAC01C774C5D0C694002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맛의 취향은 사람마다 제각각이니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DBC7580020CDE8D5A5C7400020C0ACB78CB9C8B2E40020C81CAC01AC01C774B2C8AE4CC694002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님 덕분에 짠맛이 난 이유를\n알 수 있었어요. 정말 감사해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B2D80020B355BD84C5D00020C9E0B9DBC7740020B09C0020C774C720B97C000AC54C0020C2180020C788C5C8C5B4C694002E0020C815B9D00020AC10C0ACD574C694002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맛의 취향은 사람마다 제각각이지만\n모두에게 사랑받는 커피를 만들겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DBC7580020CDE8D5A5C7400020C0ACB78CB9C8B2E40020C81CAC01AC01C774C9C0B9CC000ABAA8B450C5D0AC8C0020C0ACB791BC1BB2940020CEE4D53CB97C0020B9CCB4E4ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401C00000",
